// tiny-orchestra package (CC0 1.0), nature sounds and soft firework sounds (sources and licences in the CREDITS.md of the samples folder).
// synth.js plays them. Until they are decoded, or where a browser cannot decode them, the built-in instrument named as the
// fallback plays the note instead, so no note is ever lost; an instrument with no close built-in sound (the horns, which an organ
// would replace) and the nature and firework sounds have none, and are left silent instead.
// ring: how long a struck or plucked note may ring after its written length before it is gently damped (fewer voices, a clearer texture).
// gain: the level of each instrument in the mix (balanced by measurement against the built-in instruments).
